              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Olundi ghaidhagho omusaadha eyava e Baali Shalisha ng'aleeteire mu nsawo ye ebirime ebisooka okukungulwa eri Elisha omuntu wa Katonda. Mwalimu obufaaganda obw'engaano ye baakakungula, n'emigaati amakumi abiri egya sayiri ye baasooka okukungula. Elisha yaakoba omugheereza we ati: “Ebyo bighe abantu balye.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aye omugheereza we yaamukoba ati: “Nnaasobola ntya okugha obuntu buno bwonka, eri abantu ekikumi.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.43"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
